# Usage example 4 — unresolved mention.
# Design inspired by ambiguity datasets; authored here, no external rows copied.
# Domain: maintenance sites.
#
# Message: "Was Bay A serviced?" The model writes "Bay A" as written; the host
# lexicon knows two bays with that label, so the correct host outcome is a
# clarification with the pending problem, not a guessed identity.
@question query
  where match
    relation "serviced"
    role subject "Bay A"
    polarity affirmed
  end
